{"slug":"Practice/Python/260810-shared-list-bug/index","title":"260810-shared-list-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.123Z","minutes":3,"html":"<p>상위: <a href=\"note:Practice/Python/README\" class=\"wikilink\" data-note=\"Practice/Python/README\">Python</a> · <a href=\"note:Practice/README\" class=\"wikilink\" data-note=\"Practice/README\">Practice</a></p>\n<div class=\"practice-tabs\"><div class=\"practice-tab-bar\" role=\"tablist\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"practice-tab-btn active\"><span>🧩</span><span>problem-origin.py</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"practice-tab-btn\"><span>✅</span><span>problem-solve.py</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"practice-tab-btn\"><span>📝</span><span>note.md</span></button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" data-kind=\"origin\" class=\"practice-tab-panel active\">\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShoppingCart</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"장바구니에 아이템을 담는 클래스.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    add_item으로 아이템을 담고, items로 확인한다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"