"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_a.add_item(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ShoppingCart(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_b.add_item(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"banana\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart_a.name, cart_a.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart_b.name, cart_b.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __name__</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"__main__\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    demo()</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><div role=\"tabpanel\" data-kind=\"solve\" class=\"practice-tab-panel\">\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShoppingCart</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"장바구니에 아이템을 담는 클래스.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    add_item으로 아이템을 담고, items로 확인한다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, name, items</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add_item</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, item):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items.append(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_a </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ShoppingCart(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_a.add_item(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ShoppingCart(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cart_b.add_item(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"banana\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart_a.name, cart_a.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart_b.name, cart_b.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __name__</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"__main__\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    demo()</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><div role=\"tabpanel\" data-kind=\"note\" class=\"practice-tab-panel\">\n<h3 id=\"연습--공유-리스트-버그-찾기\">연습 — 공유 리스트 버그 찾기</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>문제: <code>problem.py</code>의 <code>ShoppingCart</code>가 서로 다른 인스턴스인데도 아이템 목록을 공유한다.</li>\n<li>유형: 디버깅 (클로저 예제보다 난이도 상향 — 스코프가 아니라 인자 기본값의 생명주기 문제)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"재현\">재현</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cart_a </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ShoppingCart(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cart_a.add_item(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cart_b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ShoppingCart(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cart_b.add_item(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"banana\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart_a.name, cart_a.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart_b.name, cart_b.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 기대: A ['apple'] / B ['banana']  (서로 독립된 목록)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 실제: ?</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>직접 <code>python problem.py</code>로 실행해서 실제 출력을 확인해보세요.</p>\n<h4 id=\"진행-방법\">진행 방법</h4>\n<p>디버깅 루틴을 따라 아래 순서로 풀어보세요. AI 도구 없이 먼저 시도할 것.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>재현 — 위 코드를 실행해서 실제로 두 카트가 아이템을 공유하는지 확인</li>\n<li>가설 — 왜 <code>cart_a</code>와 <code>cart_b</code>가 같은 리스트를 참조하게 되는지 문장으로 적기</li>\n<li>검증 — 가설대로 수정 후 재실행해서 두 목록이 독립적인지 확인</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"접근\">접근</h4>\n<p>현재 init func (뭐라고부르는지 모르겠네)을 보면 items=[]으로 default가 선언된 리스트로 받고 있다.\ninit은 class를 초기화하는 함수이기 때문에 클래스가 처음호출 될 때 초기화로 한번 실행? 되는 느낌이고, __new__는 그게 아니라 매번 실행되는 느낌이라 차이가 있어서그 문제일 것으로 판단됨.\n이 리스트는 상수처럼 객체 자체를 받는 것이기 때문에 cart_a, cart_b를 선언할 때 같은 리스트를참조하게 되고,\n그렇기 때문에 __new__로 바꾸어주면 된다.</p>\n<p>지금은 내가 생각한대로 선언시 새로운 list를 <code>list()</code>를 통해 생성해주는 식으로 해결했지만, 해당 방식이 아닌 init을 수정함에 따라 변경하는 방법도 있을 것으로 생각됨.</p>\n<h4 id=\"관련-개념\">관련 개념</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"wikilink-broken\">가변 기본값 인자 (Python)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"회고\">회고</h4>\n<p>접근의 윗문다는 그냥 <code>__new__</code>를 모르는 무지한 나의 잘못된 생각이고, 클로드에게 피드백을 요청하니 우선 이 문제에서는 아래와 같은 두 가지를 정리해 놔야될 필요성을 알게 되었다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>__init__</code>과 <code>__new__</code>의 차이점 정리</li>\n<li>새로운 인스턴스를 default 매개변수처럼 사용해서 공유하지 않는 방법 (해답 자체)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>1번의 경우, 개념적인 부분이기에 자세한 사항은 따로 정리한다.</p>\n<h5 id=\"2번-해답-풀이\">2번 (해답 풀이)</h5>\n<p>클로드가 내준 방안은 default 파라미터를 리스트가 아닌 None으로 선언하는 것이다.</p>\n<pre><code>def __init__(self,name,items=None):\n</code></pre>\n<p>이러한 식으로 선언하였을 때, 실제 선언시 이미 존재하는 리스트인스턴스를 참조하게 되면 items가 그 리스트로 받게되지만, 선언시 리스트가 없다면 <code>items=None</code>이 되버린다.\n그리고 실제 구현시 <code>self.items= items</code> 부분을 아래와 같이 바꾼다.</p>\n<pre><code>self.items= items if items is not None else []\n</code></pre>\n<p>이런 식으로 구현할 경우, 매개변수로 받은 <code>items</code>가 <code>None</code>인 경우 <code>__init__</code>이 호출 될 때마다 내부에서 새로운 리스트 인스턴스를 생성하여 연결하기에 공유 리스트가 생성되지 않는다.</p></div></div>","toc":[{"depth":3,"id":"연습--공유-리스트-버그-찾기","text":"연습 — 공유 리스트 버그 찾기"},{"depth":4,"id":"재현","text":"재현"},{"depth":4,"id":"진행-방법","text":"진행 방법"},{"depth":4,"id":"접근","text":"접근"},{"depth":4,"id":"관련-개념","text":"관련 개념"},{"depth":4,"id":"회고","text":"회고"}],"backlinks":[{"slug":"Practice/Python/README","title":"Python","excerpt":"상위: Practice"}]}